Spec: Profile

Purpose:
  The rider's name and profile photo, shared by onboarding, Home and the profile edit sheet.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  /test/profile

References:
  /docs/specs/history/09-onboarding.md
  /docs/specs/history/14-settings-profile.md

Must:
  The photo is blank by default.
  The last `5` photos are kept, newest first; adding a sixth deletes the evicted file.
  Deleting the current photo makes it blank and deletes the file.
  Photos are picked and cropped square (`512` px, quality `85`) behind @ProfilePhotoPicker and saved to app files.
  The profile edit sheet hugs its content, saves the name on Save and persists photo changes at once.
